{"archive_kind":"manual_archive_of_ai_browser_rendered_page_excerpts","excerpts":["Homebuilding revenue for the fiscal year decreased 7% to $31.5 billion, and homes closed decreased 5% to 84,863 homes. Homebuilding pre-tax income decreased 24% to $4.1 billion, and pre-tax profit margin was 13.1%. Net sales orders decreased 4% to 83,423 homes and 6% in value to $30.8 billion. The cancellation rate was 18% in both fiscal 2025 and 2024.","The Company’s cancellation rate (cancelled sales orders divided by gross sales orders) was 20% compared to 21% in the prior year quarter."],"industry_id":"housing_durables","locator":"Fiscal 2025 operating results; fiscal year ended September 30, 2025","not_full_original_document":true,"observations":[{"component":"home_order_cancellation_rate","conversion":"percent_divided_by_100","excerpt_indices":[0,1],"name_zh":"全年住宅毛销售订单取消率","parent_metric_id":"housing_durables_driver_1","period_end":"2025-09-30","period_start":"2024-10-01","period_type":"annual","raw_unit":"percent","raw_value":"18","scope":"homebuilding_cancelled_sales_orders_over_gross_sales_orders","unit":"ratio","value":"0.18"},{"component":"homes_closed","conversion":"remove_thousands_separator","excerpt_indices":[0],"name_zh":"全年完成结算交付住宅数","parent_metric_id":"housing_durables_driver_2","period_end":"2025-09-30","period_start":"2024-10-01","period_type":"annual","raw_unit":"homes","raw_value":"84,863","scope":"homebuilding","unit":"homes","value":"84863"}],"observed_at":"2026-10-11T04:17:03+00:00","published_date":null,"source_url":"https://investor.drhorton.com/news-and-events/press-releases/2025/10-28-2025-103117295"}